<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-11352] CacheMetricsSnapshot deserialization may be broken in some cases</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-11352</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;There is an incompatible changes in&#160;CacheMetricsSnapshot serialization between 2.4&#160;and 2.7 versions. This may affect users if the event is being stored to some external storage. The fix should be fairly simple as there is already some code that checks the stream contents.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
